<title>FINLAND: Tampella swings to Jan-Aug profit.</title>
<headline>Tampella swings to Jan-Aug profit.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months to August 31--</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax   109 vs 127 loss</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		 0.39 vs 1.70 loss/shr</p>
<p> Net sales					2,876 vs 2,730</p>
<p> Operating profit				 151 vs 67 loss</p>
<p> Depreciation				  106 vs 135</p>
<p> Net financial items		 charge 42 vs 60 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary items		   gain 14 vs 168 charge</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, tax     123 vs 295 loss</p>
<p> Minorities			    charge 17 vs 17 charge</p>
<p> Taxes					    45 vs 22</p>
